Hi Avery,

Here's what's new for your Zoom Workplace account this month.

AI Companion 3
Meeting summaries now include action items assigned to attendees, and you can ask Companion about any past meeting from the desktop app. Included with your plan at no extra cost.

Shared whiteboards
Whiteboards persist across meetings and can be shared with people outside your account by link.

Clips
Record a short video message from any Zoom window and share it by link, no meeting required.

Explore what's new: https://zoom.us/whats-new?m=0302

Tip: turn on "smart recording" in Settings > Recording to get chapters and highlights automatically.

